{
  "name": "Wizard",
  "description": "Scholars defined by exhaustive study of magic's inner workings. Wizards master spells of explosive fire, arcing lightning, subtle deception, and spectacular transformations. Their mightiest magic can change matter, call down meteors, or open portals between worlds.",
