            "casting_time": "1 action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "19": {
      "Epic Boon": "You gain an Epic Boon feat or another feat of your choice for which you qualify. Boon of Spell Recall is recommended."
    },
    "20": {
      "Signature Spells": {
        "description": "Choose two level 3 spells in your spellbook as your signature spells. You always have these spells prepared, and you can cast each of them once at level 3 without expending a spell slot. When you do so, you can't cast them in this way again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.",
